# 🔐 Password Cracking with John the Ripper  

## 🎯 Objective  
The goal of this lab was to identify a password hashing algorithm from a leaked file and attempt to crack the hash using John the Ripper.  

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Commands  
- **Linux Command Line**  
- **hash-id** (hash identification)  
- **John the Ripper** (password cracking)  
- **Wordlist:** darkweb2017-top10000.txt  

```bash
# Navigate to Documents folder
cd ~/Documents/

# View hash file
cat hash.txt

# Identify hash algorithm
cat hash.txt | python3 hash-id.py

# Crack the hash using John the Ripper with a wordlist
john-the-ripper --format=raw-md5 hash.txt --wordlist=darkweb2017-top10000.txt
